# Component Workflow

- This repository is a component library published to npm with Storybook docs.
- Keep component source structure in `lib/components/<ComponentName>/`:
  - `<ComponentName>.tsx`
  - `<ComponentName>.module.scss`
  - `index.ts`
  - `types/index.ts`
  - optional `hooks/`, `utils/`, `constants/` only when needed.
- In component implementation:
  - import local styles from `./<ComponentName>.module.scss`;
  - import local types from `./types`;
  - import other library components relatively from `../<OtherComponent>`.
- Export only public API from `lib/components/<ComponentName>/index.ts`.
- Every public component/type/hook/enum must be wired in `lib/test-stpr-ui-kit.ts` via imports and exports.
- Preserve backward compatibility intentionally:
  - if API changes are breaking, call it out explicitly and provide migration guidance.
- Required delivery chain for component changes:
  1) update/add component in `lib/components`;
  2) mandatory update of component stories in `src/stories` for every added component or public API change;
  3) update `CHANGELOG.md` using changelog rule;
  4) start post-change verification by running the `project-health-check` skill from `.cursor/skills/project-health-check/SKILL.md`;
  5) run verification commands: `npm run lint`, `npm run build:lib`, `npm run build:storybook`.
